## Foundation-model depth priors

The cache builders download model weights at run time; no weights are
redistributed here.

- MapAnything (`facebook/map-anything-apache`) - Apache-2.0. Used by
  `code/build_ma_cache.py`.
- Depth Anything V2 - used by `code/build_dav2_cache.py` via
  `transformers.AutoModelForDepthEstimation`.
- Depth Anything 3 - used by `code/build_da3m_cache.py` via
  `depth_anything_3`.

Verify the current license of each model before redistribution.

